# Production site URL (absolute HTTPS origin, e.g. https://taif.example.com).
# Used for canonical URLs, hreflang alternates, OG/Twitter tags and the sitemap.
# It is currently UNKNOWN. When unset:
#  - local/preview builds omit all absolute tags (with a console warning);
#  - a production build (NODE_ENV=production) fails with a clear error.
# This is the only environment variable the site uses. No secrets.
SITE_URL=
